composition "Welcome to AMPLE" { ample 1  tempo 175  master-seed 175175 }

# WELCOME TO AMPLE: the demo song every project starts with. 60 bars at 175 BPM (about 1:22).
# Play it, change it, break it: this file can be edited as much as you like. For now it cannot be deleted (a project always has a song to open).
# Make your own songs next to it. Everything below is plain text: the song IS this text.
#
#   bars  1-8   intro: piano and pad, hats and the kick come in
#   bars  9-16  build: the full beat and the bass
#   bars 17-32  drop 1: everything, with the hook
#   bars 33-40  breakdown: piano and pad, a snare roll back into
#   bars 41-56  drop 2: everything, the hook an octave up
#   bars 57-60  outro
#
# Try: change the tempo above (175) to 160 for a slower one, or "wave saw" to "wave square" in the lead, press Build, and listen again.
# The chords are Am, F, C, G, one bar each, over and over; the hook is four bars on those chords.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ piano (General MIDI program 0, from the SoundFont)
